+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|
+| Majority baseline (always 1) | 0.4349 | 0.7697 | 0.0000 | 0.8698 | N/A | done |
+| DistilBERT text-only | 0.4903* | 0.6123* | 0.2409* | 0.7397* | 28.0 s* | Text Group pipeline not delivered; *frozen-feature probe below |
+| CLIP image-only (image group, linear head) | 0.5276 | 0.6266 | 0.3113 | 0.7439 | 2.7 s (CUDA) | done (image group) |
+| **DistilBERT + CLIP multimodal** (`20261016_distilbert_clip_seed42`) | **0.5336** | **0.6567** | **0.2941** | **0.7732** | 43.5 s (CPU, head only) | done |
+
+*Text-only row: frozen DistilBERT `[CLS]` + the same MLP head (`configs/ablations/text_only.json`). It does not replace the Text Group's DistilBERT classifier. Training time excludes feature extraction. On this 4-vCPU machine, DistilBERT took 83 s for all splits. CLIP took 13.5 min for all splits, but the train split ran while another job shared the CPU; validation and test alone ran at about 32 images/s.
+
+*文字行：冻结 DistilBERT `[CLS]` + 同样的 MLP 分类头（`configs/ablations/text_only.json`），不能代替文字组的 DistilBERT 分类器。训练时间不含特征提取。在这台 4 vCPU 机器上，DistilBERT 全部划分用时 83 秒；CLIP 全部划分用时 13.5 分钟，但 train 划分运行时有其他任务占用 CPU，validation 与 test 单独运行约每秒 32 张。
